408
00:44:35.107 --> 00:44:36.412
Men with guns.

409
00:44:36.456 --> 00:44:37.936
Get out of there.

410
00:44:40.895 --> 00:44:43.071
It's encrypted.
I don't have access.

411
00:44:46.205 --> 00:44:47.597
Print it. Everything.

412
00:44:53.778 --> 00:44:54.996
Is it printing or not?

413
00:44:55.040 --> 00:44:57.390
- Yeah, it's coming.
