It's not even
our main concern.

434
00:50:12.313 --> 00:50:14.228
You're not
like any reporter
I've ever met.

435
00:50:16.665 --> 00:50:19.277
That's 'cause
I'm the best, right?

436
00:50:19.320 --> 00:50:21.322
Isn't that
what your father said?

437
00:50:44.302 --> 00:50:46.826
- Fuck!
- What's wrong?

438
00:50:48.132 --> 00:50:49.829
